{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Janabe Sakina (s.a.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمنِ الرَّحيمِ\nbismi allahi alrrahmani alrrahimi\nIn the name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلى آدَمَ صِفْوَةِ اللهِ،\nalssalamu `ala adama sifwati allahi\nPeace be upon Adam, the chosen one of Allah,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلى نُوح نَبِيِّ اللهِ،\nalssalamu `ala nuhin nabiyyi allahi\npeace be upon Nuh, the Prophet of Allah,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلى اِبْراهيمَ خَليِل اللهِ،\nalssalamu `ala ibrahima khalili allahi\npeace be upon Ibrahim, the intimate friend of Allah,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلى مُوسى كَليِم اللهِ،\nalssalamu `ala musa kalimi allahi\npeace be upon Musa, he who spoke with Allah,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلى عيسى رُوحِ اللهِ،\nalssalamu `ala `isa ruhi allahi\npeace be upon `Isa, the spirit of Allah,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا رَسُولَ اللهِ،\nalssalamu `alayka ya rasula allahi\npeace be upon you, O Messenger of Allah,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا خَيْرَ خَلْقِ اللهِ،\nalssalamu `alayka ya khayra khalqi allahi\npeace be upon you, O best of Allah’s creation,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا صَفِيَّ اللهِ،\nalssalamu `alayka ya safiyya allahi\npeace be upon you, O the chosen one of Allah,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا مُحَمَّدَ بْنَ عَبْدِ اللهِ خاتَمَ النَّبِيّينَ،\nalssalamu `alayka ya muhammada bna `abdi allahi khatama alnnabiyyina\npeace be upon you, O Muhammad, son of `Abdullah, Seal of the Prophets,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا اَميرَ الْمُؤْمِنينَ عَلِيَّ بْنَ اَبي طالِب وَصِيَّ رَسُولِ اللهِ،\nalssalamu `alayka ya amira almu'minina `aliyya bna abi talibin wasiyya rasuli allahi\npeace be upon you, O Commander of the Faithful, `Ali the son of Abu Talib, successor of the Messenger of Allah,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ يا فاطِمَةُ سَيِّدَةَ نِساءِ اْلعالَمينَ،\nalssalamu `alayki ya fatimatu sayyidata nisa'i al`alamina\npeace be upon you, O Fatimah, mistress of the women of the worlds,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكُما يا سِبْطَيْ نَبِيِّ الرَّحْمَةِ وَسَيِّدَيْ شَبابِ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ،\nalssalamu `alaykuma ya sibtay nabiyyi alrrahmati wa sayyiday shababi ahli aljannati\npeace be upon you both, O the two grandsons of the Prophet of Mercy and the two masters of the youth of Paradise,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا عَلِيَّ بْنَ اْلحُسَيْنِ سَيِّدَ الْعابِدينَ وَقُرَّةَ عَيْنِ النّاظِرينَ،\nalssalamu `alayka ya `aliyya bna alhusayni sayyida al`abidina wa qurrata `ayni alnnazirina\npeace be upon you, O `Ali the son of al-Husain, master of the worshippers and the delight of those who behold him,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا مُحَمَّدَ بْنَ عَلِيّ باقِرَ الْعِلْمِ بَعْدَ النَّبِيِّ،\nalssalamu `alayka ya muhammada bna `aliyyin baqira al`ilmi ba`da alnnabiyyi\npeace be upon you, O Muhammad the son of `Ali, discloser of knowledge after the Prophet,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا جَعْفَرَ بْنَ مُحَمَّد الصّادِقَ الْبارَّ الاَْمينَ،\nalssalamu `alayka ya ja`fara bna muhammadin alssadiqa albarra al-amina\npeace be upon you, O Ja`far the son of Muhammad, the truthful, the dutiful, the trustworthy,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا مُوسَى بْنَ جَعْفَر الطّاهِرَ الطُّهْرَ،\nalssalamu `alayka ya musa bna ja`farin alttahira alttuhra\npeace be upon you, O Musa the son of Ja`far, the pure, the immaculate,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا عَلِيَّ بْنَ مُوسَى الرِّضَا اْلمُرْتَضى،\nalssalamu `alayka ya `aliyya bna musa alrrida almurtada\npeace be upon you, O `Ali the son of Musa, al-Rida, the well-pleasing,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا مُحَمَّدَ بْنَ عَلِيّ التَّقِيَّ،\nalssalamu `alayka ya muhammada bna `aliyyin alttaqiyya\npeace be upon you, O Muhammad the son of `Ali, the pious,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا عَلِيَّ بْنَ مُحَمَّد النَّقِيَّ النّاصِحَ الأَْمينَ،\nalssalamu `alayka ya `aliyya bna muhammadin alnnaqiyya alnnasiha al-amina\npeace be upon you, O `Ali the son of Muhammad, the pure, the sincere advisor, the trustworthy,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكَ يا حَسَنَ بْنَ عَلِيّ،\nalssalamu `alayka ya hasana bna `aliyyin\npeace be upon you, O al-Hasan the son of `Ali,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَى الْوَصِيِّ مِنْ بَعْدِهِ،\nalssalamu `ala alwasiyyi min ba`dihi\npeace be upon the successor after him.\nاَلّلهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلى نُورِكَ وَسِراجِكَ وَوَلِيِّ وَلِيِّكَ،\nallahumma salli `ala nurika wa sirajika wa waliyyi waliyyika\nO Allah, send blessings upon Your light, Your lamp, and the guardian appointed by Your guardian,\nوَوَصِيِّ وَصِيِّكَ،\nwa wasiyyi wasiyyika\nand the successor appointed by Your successor,\nوَحُجَّتِكَ عَلى خَلْقِكَ،\nwa hujjatika `ala khalqika\nand Your Argument over Your creation.\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ يا بِنْتَ رَسُولِ اللهِ،\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta rasuli allahi\nPeace be upon you, O daughter of the Messenger of Allah,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ يا بِنْتَ فاطِمَةَ وَخَديجَةَ،\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta fatimata wa khadijata\npeace be upon you, O daughter of Fatimah and Khadijah,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ يا بِنْتَ اَميرِ الْمُؤْمِنينَ،\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta amiri almu'minina\npeace be upon you, O daughter of the Commander of the Faithful,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ يا بِنْتَ وَلِيِّ اللهِ،\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta waliyyi allahi\npeace be upon you, O daughter of the intimate friend of Allah,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ يا اُخْتَ وَلِيِّ اللهِ،\nalssalamu `alayki ya ukhta waliyyi allahi\npeace be upon you, O sister of the intimate friend of Allah,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ يا عَمَّةَ وَلِيِّ اللهِ،\nalssalamu `alayki ya `ammata waliyyi allahi\npeace be upon you, O paternal aunt of the intimate friend of Allah,\nالَسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ يا رُقَيَّةَُ بِنْتَ اْلحُسَيْنِ الشَّهيدِ وَرَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَبَرَكاتُهُ،\nalssalamu `alayki ya ruqayyata binta alhusayni alshshahidi wa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\npeace be upon you, O Ruqayyah, daughter of al-Husain the martyr, and Allah’s mercy and blessings,\nالَسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا الصَّغيرَةُ الشَّهيدَةُ،\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha alssaghiratu alshshahidatu\npeace be upon you, O the little martyred girl,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا الْمَقْهُورَةُ الْمَظْلُومَةُ،\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha almaqhuratu almazlumatu\npeace be upon you, O the overpowered, wronged one,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا الْفاضِلَةُ الْرَّشيدَةُ،\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha alfadilatu alrrashidatu\npeace be upon you, O the virtuous, rightly-guided one,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا الْجَليلَةُ الْجَميلَةُ،\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha aljalilatu aljamilatu\npeace be upon you, O the noble, the beautiful one,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا الْبَعيدَةُ عَنِ الأَْوْطانِ،\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha alba`idatu `ani al-awtani\npeace be upon you, O the one kept far from her homeland,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا الأَْسيرَةُ فِى الْبُلْدانِ،\nalssalamu `alayki ayyatuha al-asiratu fi albuldani\npeace be upon you, O the one held captive across the lands,\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ يا مَوْلاتي وَابْنَةَ مَوْلايَ،\nalssalamu `alayki ya mawlati wabnata mawlaya\npeace be upon you, O my mistress and daughter of my master,\nوَسَيِّدَتي وَابْنَةَ سَيِّدي وَرَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَبَرَكاتُهُ،\nwa sayyidati wabnata sayyidi wa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\nand my lady and daughter of my lord, and Allah’s mercy and blessings.\nفَلَعَنَ اللهُ مَنْ جَحَدَكِ،\nfala`ana allahu man jahadaki\nMay Allah curse whoever denied you your right,\nوَلَعَنَ اللهُ مَنْ ظَلَمَكِ،\nwala`ana allahu man zalamaki\nand may Allah curse whoever wronged you,\nوَلَعَنَ اللهُ مَنْ ضَرَبَكِ،\nwala`ana allahu man darabaki\nand may Allah curse whoever struck you,\nوَلَعَنَ اللهُ مَنْ لَمْ يَعْرِفْ حَقَّكِ،\nwala`ana allahu man lam ya`rif haqqaki\nand may Allah curse whoever did not recognize your right,\nوَلَعَنَ اللهُ اَعْداءَ آلِ مُحَمَّد،\nwala`ana allahu a`da'a ali muhammadin\nand may Allah curse the enemies of the Household of Muhammad,\nمِنَ الْجِنِّ وَالاِْنْسِ،\nmina aljinni wal-insi\nfrom among the jinn and mankind,\nمِنَ الأَْوَّلينَ وَالاْخِرينَ،\nmina al-awwalina wal-akhirina\nfrom the first generations and the last,\nوَضاعَفَ عَلَيْهِمُ الْعَذابَ الأَْليمَ،\nwa da`afa `alayhimu al`adhaba al-alima\nand may He double the painful torment upon them.\nاَتَيْتُكِ يا مَوْلاتي وَابْنَةَ مَوْلايَ،\nataytuki ya mawlati wabnata mawlaya\nI have come to you, O my mistress and daughter of my master,\nقاصِداً وافِداً عارِفاً بِحَقِّكِ،\nqasidan wafidan `arifan bihaqqiki\nintending, arriving, knowing your right.\nاَلسَّلامُ عَلَيْكِ عَرَّفَ اللهُ بَيْنَنا وَبَيْنَكُمْ فِى الْجَنَّةِ،\nalssalamu `alayki `arrafa allahu baynana wa baynakum fi aljannati\nPeace be upon you; may Allah make us known to you in Paradise,\nوَحَشَرَنا في زُمْرَتِكُمْ،\nwa hasharana fi zumratikum\nand gather us in your company,\nوَاَوْرَدَنا حَوْضَ نَبيِّكُمْ،\nwa awradana hawda nabiyyikum\nand bring us to the pool of your Prophet,\nوَسَقانا بِكَاْسِ جَدِّكُمْ مِنْ يَدِ عَلِيِّ بْنِ اَبي طالِب صَلَواتُ اللهِ عَلَيْكُمْ،\nwa saqana bika'si jaddikum min yadi `aliyyi bni abi talibin salawatu allahi `alaykum\nand give us to drink from the cup of your grandfather, by the hand of `Ali the son of Abu Talib – Allah’s blessings be upon you all.\nاَسْئَلُ اللهَ اَنْ يُرِيَنا فيكُمُ السّرُوُرَ وَالْفَرَجَ،\nas'alu allaha an yuriyana fikumu alssurura walfaraja\nI ask Allah to show us, through you, joy and relief,\nوَاَنْ يَجْمَعَنا وَاِيّاكُمْ في زُمْرَةِ جَدِّكُمْ مُحَمَّد صَلَّى اللهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ،\nwa an yajma`ana wa iyyakum fi zumrati jaddikum muhammadin salla allahu `alayhi wa alihi\nand to gather us together with you in the company of your grandfather Muhammad, may Allah’s blessings be upon him and his family,\nوَاَنْ لا يَسْلُبَنا مَعْرِفَتَكُمْ اِنَّهُ وَلِيٌّ قَديرٌ،\nwa an la yaslubana ma`rifatakum innahu waliyyun qadirun\nand not to strip us of our recognition of you; indeed He is a capable Guardian.\nاَتَقَرَّبُ اِلىَ اللهِ بِحُبِّكُمْ،\nataqarrabu ila allahi bihubbikum\nI seek nearness to Allah through love of you,\nوَالْبَرائَةِ مِنْ اَعْدائِكُمْ،\nwalbara'ati min a`da'ikum\nand through disavowal of your enemies,\nوَالتَّسْليمِ اِلَى اللهِ،\nwalttaslimi ila allahi\nand through submission to Allah,\nراضِياً بِهِ غَيْرَ مُنْكِر وَلا مُسْتَكْبِر،\nradiyan bihi ghayra munkirin wa la mustakbirin\ncontent with Him, neither denying nor arrogant,\nوَعَلى يَقينِ ما اَتى بِهِ مُحَمَّدٌ،\nwa `ala yaqinin ma ata bihi muhammadun\nand with certainty in what Muhammad brought,\nوَبِهِ راض نَطْلُبُ بِذلِكَ وَجْهَكَ يا سَيِّدى،\nwa bihi radin natlubu bidhalika wajhaka ya sayyidi\nand pleased with it; by this we seek Your countenance, O my Lord.\nاَللّهُمَّ وَرِضاكَ وَالدّارَ الاْخِرَةَ يا رُقَيَّةُ اشْفَعي لي فِى الْجَنَّةِ،\nallahumma wa ridaka waldddara al-akhirata ya ruqayyatu ashfa`i li fi aljannati\nO Allah, (we also seek) Your good pleasure and the Abode of the Hereafter. O Ruqayyah, intercede for me for Paradise,\nفَاِنَّ لَكِ عِنْدَ اللهِ شَاْناً مِنَ الشَّاْنِ،\nfa'inna laki `inda allahi sha'nan mina alshsha'ni\nfor indeed you have, with Allah, a great standing.\nاَللّهُمَّ اِنّى اَسْئَلُكَ اَنْ تَخْتِمَ لى بِالسَّعادَةِ،\nallahumma inni as'aluka an takhtima li bilssa`adati\nO Allah, I ask You to seal my life with happiness,\nفَلا تَسْلُبْ مِّنى ما اَنَا فيهِ،\nfala taslub minni ma ana fihi\nso do not strip from me what I am in,\nوَلا حَوْلَ وَلا قُوَّةَ اِلاّ بِاللهِ الْعَلِىِّ الْعَظيمِ،\nwa la hawla wa la quwwata illa billahi al`aliyyi al`azimi\nand there is no power and no strength except by Allah, the Exalted, the Magnificent.\nاَللّهُمَّ اسْتَجِبْ لَنا وَتَقَبَّلْهُ بِكَرَمِكَ وَعِزَّتِكَ،\nallahumma istajib lana wa taqabbalhu bikaramika wa `izzatika\nO Allah, answer us, and accept this by Your generosity and Your might,\nوَبِرَحْمَتِكَ وَعافِيَتِكَ،\nwa birahmatika wa `afiyatika\nand by Your mercy and Your grace,\nوَصَلَّى اللهُ عَلى مُحَمَّد وَآلِهِ اَجْمَعينَ،\nwa salla allahu `ala muhammadin wa alihi ajma`ina\nand may Allah send blessings upon Muhammad and all of his family,\nوَسَّلَمَ تَسْليماً يا اَرْحَمَ الرّاحِمينَ.\nwa sallama tasliman ya arhama alrrahimina\nand grant abundant peace, O Most Merciful of the merciful."
}
